The item preview window has been improved.Auction House PreviewNPC Shop PreviewPreview of the dye windowPreview the title selection window effectPreview of the facilities to be installed on Moonlight IslandPreview of GlyphwrightingPreview Beauty Coupons and Storage CouponsPreview actions may be restricted in the Transformations, Nascent Divinity, Demigod states.The size of the view area is expanded.You can freely adjust the background color brightness.You can move the camera position by right-clicking in any preview view.Improved preview window applies to the views below.
//g.nexonstatic.com/media/joxos2yl/title-preview-improvements.gif
The right-click menu for items has been improved.Only the list of functional buttons is displayed.The 'Item Description' section, where the same information as the item tooltip was displayed repeatedly, has been omitted.Right-clicking on an object will highlight it with brackets and a blue background.
//g.nexonstatic.com/media/q3hdbbok/item-right-click-ui.png

Some features of the item inventory have been improved.With the item inventory window open, click on your inventory or bag and then press ESC to close the inventory window all at once.If there is a new item in your item inventory, it will be highlighted with a yellow background and an "N".Improved item inventory closing functionality.Improved visibility when acquiring new items in your item inventory.
//g.nexonstatic.com/media/zsbf1i0s/new-item-ui.png

The status effect of Mana Shield has been modified to visibly show your total Mana in Blue over the Health Bar above your character.When a Harmonic Saint's Veil of Life has been applied, the bar will be green with the Veil of Life Health instead.
//g.nexonstatic.com/media/addlwzvt/mana-shield-health-bar.png
You now have the option to choose which Music Buffs you wish to share and receive.A "Sharing Settings" button has been added to the bottom of the Music Tab in your Skill UI.An option to set a shortcut to access the Share Settings Menu has also been added.The "Party Music Buff Sharing" option has been moved from the Options Menu to the Music Buff Sharing Settings menu.You can choose whether to give or receive the following Musical Buffs to/from your party members:Battlefield OvertureEnduring MelodyVivaceMarch SongHarvest SongYou will only be able to share and receive buffs from the skills you've learned. 
//g.nexonstatic.com/media/os1coifi/music-buff-sharing.png
An option to immediately use specific skills after loading has been added.The option to enable/disable is located on the Skill Info Window for each skill.The flash when landing a Critical Hit will no longer obscure your UI or hide the items in your inventory.The Status List has been improved, allowing one to edit the status effects shown on themselves. 
By Favoriting, you can set a status to always show, even when inactive. Inactive effects will be greyed out.By Hiding, you can set a status to never show, regardless of if it is active or inactive.A Status history will also be visible for statuses your character receives during your play session. These inactive statuses can be added to the Hidden or Favorites list.If the status icons are under the character name instead of the Status List Window during editing, the changes will not be saved.
//g.nexonstatic.com/media/uxsni4ey/status-list-changes-v3.png
Feedback Noted! We’ve restored the “Reserve Attack” functionality and is available in the Gameplay → Control area of the Options Menu.
